1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,040
kW at kWh… pareho
lang ba 'yan?

2
00:00:04,390 --> 00:00:07,160
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

3
00:00:07,510 --> 00:00:12,600
Ang kW ay power: gaano
kabilis gumamit ng kuryente.

4
00:00:12,850 --> 00:00:17,920
Ang kWh ay energy: gaano
karami ang nagamit.

5
00:00:18,220 --> 00:00:21,950
Halimbawa, isang
100-watt na TV.

6
00:00:22,050 --> 00:00:23,970
Kapag binuksan
mo nang 10 oras,

7
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:26,210
1 kWh ang nagamit nito.

8
00:00:26,510 --> 00:00:31,810
Sa Meralco bill, kWh ang
basehan ng energy charges.

9
00:00:32,110 --> 00:00:38,240
Kaya bago mag-solar,
kilalanin pareho: kW at kWh.

10
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:43,910
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

11
00:00:44,260 --> 00:00:46,660
Life is SoLight with Solar.
